WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A research workbench for comparing speech-enhancement methods.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose a controlled environment and set the input SNR.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:34.000
One input is processed through multiple tested paths.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Listen to every output; filtering alone is not quality.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
A score needs the right reference. Unavailable values stay unavailable.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Inspect the real spectrogram and make a non-destructive edit.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Export the evidence and reproduce the work.
